      "description": "Gives +3 Revivals. Consuming a Revival gives +10% Max Health, +1 Armor, and +5% Might, Area, Duration, and Speed.",
      "notes": "- While Awake (IV) is active, the player gains 3  Revivals. Afterwards, all revives later consumed will also give 1.1x  Max Health, +1  Armor, and +5%  Might,  Area,  Duration, and  Speed. The aforementioned bonus applies to all revives, including those from the  Tirajisú, the Revival PowerUp, or Krochi's passive bonus.\n- As the player strengthens, it is harder to be killed. It is advised to use your Revivals early to get the stat boost sooner.\r\n- Phieraggi greatly benefits from this Arcana for getting +3 Base Damage and +3  Amount. It also greatly increases the base damage of the  Meal Ticket This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access. Note, however, that using up Revivals will lower the effectiveness of these weapons.\r\n- This Arcana can be used to help characters that start with low health like  Toastie,  Smith IV, and the  Fleaman This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access survive.\r\n- Genevieve Gruyère This content requires the Tides of the Foscari DLC to access and  Je-Ne-Viv This content requires the Tides of the Foscari DLC to access trigger a screen-clearing effect once per life; Awake (IV) provides more use out of them.\r\n- Cosmo Pavone and  Luminaire Foscari This content requires the Tides of the Foscari DLC to access trigger a Rosary upon reviving. Awake (IV) can enable more uses of this ability.\r\n- Luminaire Foscari has a massive amount of built-in Revives, and gains a powerful temporary bonus every time she revives, scaling with the number of times revived. This makes Awake (IV) a powerful way to scale her over the course of the game.\r\n- Guardian Pina This content requires the Emergency Meeting DLC to access has a 50% chance to gain +1 Revival when reviving. When using Awake (IV) along with items that give Revivals, they can reach a similar level of stat scaling as Luminaire Foscari.\r\n- Bats Bats Bats gains Amount based on remaining revivals and familiars upon reviving, making Awake a powerful pick."
