      "notes": "- While Chaos in the Dark Night (V) is active, overall  Speed continuously changes between -50% and +50% over 10 second intervals. The player also gains +1% Speed each time they level up. The oscillation is done by applying a multiplier on top of everything else ranging from 0.5 to 1.5, which on average, will give an overall net neutral Projectile Speed bonus.\r\n- This has an interesting interaction with  Peachone,  Ebony Wings, and the  Vandalier, where every 10 seconds the circular zone slows down, stops, changes direction, then accelerates rapidly, and every 10 seconds starting at :05 its speed doubles and halves alternately, in total causing its speed to increase every 20 seconds, causing extremely chaotic movement.\n- The Arcana only starts giving stat boosts when the player selects it and does not give extra stats retroactively. If the stats are desirable, select the Arcana early."
