      "notes": "- The healing pulse is affected by  Area. Since all the weapons also benefit from Area, they synergize well with this Arcana.\r\nRevival counts as healing to half health, and is doubled to become a full heal. If a character has high  Max Health (e.g.  Red Death, level 100+  Toastie), using a  Revival deals Max Health worth of damage to all surrounding enemies.\r\n- Healing to full also restores the HP-Critical skills of characters like  She-Moon Eeta and  Bat Robbert, making them easier to trigger again after a death.\r\n- Pairs well with  Disco of Gold (XV), as the collected coins heal for the same amount, doubled with this Arcana. Sends damaging pulses when coins are collected and applies during  Gold Fever.\r\n- Cosmo Pavone can deal massive damage with Sarabande pulses thanks to its scaling  Recovery.\r\n- This Arcana can also be useful to characters with abilities that trigger upon overhealing by a certain amount, such as  Walter Bernhard This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access, by making it easier to reach the overheal threshold.\n- This Arcana synergizes well with Revival,  Armor, and Max Health.\r\n- This Arcana doesn't actually affect the Recovery stat."
