      "notes": "- While Disco of Gold (XV) is active, collecting any amount of gold will heal the player by the same amount, and scales up with Greed. Additionally, collecting  Coin Bags and  Rich Coin Bags will trigger Gold Fever. Affected gold sources include:\r\n Vicious Hunger\r\n Gold Coins\r\n Coin Bags\r\n Rich Coin Bags\r\n Treasure Chests\r\n Big Coin Bags obtained from Treasure Chests and level ups when all of the player's weapons and passive items are fully maxed out.\n- Disco of Gold synergises perfectly with effects based on overhealing, like  Guardian's Targe This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access.\r\n- As Gold Fevers will generate a lot of coins and healing by killing enemies, pairing up with  Sarabande of Healing (VI) will double the healing and turn them into damaging pulses, fueling the killing spree even more.\r\n- Pairing up with  Wandering the Jet Black (XXI) converts the healing from gold into more damage when it retaliates.\r\n- This Arcana synergizes well with  Max Health to make use of the excess amount of healing it can generate. As one good Gold Fever can even heal level 100+  Toastie to full.\r\n- With  Greed, it further increases the effectiveness of the healing and benefits Gold Fever significantly. It also boost Big Coin Bags from leveling up enough to be a better source of healing than  Floor Chicken while also giving the player more gold.\r\n- However,  Recovery cannot multiply the healing from the coins. Other means that directly multiplies the healing effect like Sarabande of Healing (VI) or  Miang Moonspell This content requires the Legacy of the Moonspell DLC to access's passive multiplier based on Recovery can increase it besides Greed.\r\n- Starting a Gold Fever much easier greatly benefits  Millionaire This content requires the Tides of the Foscari DLC to access as the generated coins can create a lot of ammo for the weapon.\r\n- With  Vicious Hunger, Disco of Gold and enough Greed, a character can become nearly immortal.\r\n- This Arcana is extremely useful in The Bone Zone as it provides a source of healing in a level where Floor Chicken does not spawn, but coin bags are plentiful due to light sources spawning nothing but gold.\r\n- This Arcana is a must-have on  Sammy and makes it nearly immortal, though  Wicked Season (XIII) provides more levels."
